      <h1>about maiya</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="r">
      <div>est. 2026</div>

      <h3>welcome to maiya</h3>
      <p>
        maiya started with clothing, but the vision was always bigger; building a sense of belonging, to a piece, a
        feeling, a place, & a community.
        <br />
        We believe movement looks different for everyone, whether it was in the studio, on a morning walk, the places
        you discover, or in the everyday things that make you feel good.
        <br />
        we're creating pieces to live in, move in, and come back to. but more than that, we're building a community
        around a shared feeling: moving through life in your own way.
      </p>

      <h3>our world</h3>
      <p>
        maiya’s community is about the people who wear it, the energy they bring, and the connections we create along
        the way. a space for those who move differently, think freely, and find their own way of doing things.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

